- Underlying reanalysis: ERA5, produced by the Copernicus Climate Change
  Service (C3S) at ECMWF. Contains modified Copernicus Climate Change Service
  information. Neither the European Commission nor ECMWF is responsible for any
  use of the Copernicus information or data in this repository.
